@startuml Digi Bank - Discovery and Configuration
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
title Digi Bank\nDiscovery and Configuration Flow

node "Service startup" as startup
component "Customer Service" as customer
component "Account Service" as account
component "Transaction Service" as transaction
component "API Gateway" as gateway
component "Discovery Server\nregistry" as discovery
component "Config Server\nservice settings" as config
artifact "Environment variables\n(local / CI overrides)" as env

startup --> config : GET /config/{service}
config --> customer : customer settings
config --> account : account settings
config --> transaction : transaction settings
config --> gateway : gateway settings

customer --> discovery : register service
account --> discovery : register service
transaction --> discovery : register service
gateway --> discovery : lookup service
env ..> config : override values

note bottom
  Educational implementation: lightweight HTTP registry and
  configuration boundary, orchestrated by Docker Compose.
end note
@enduml
